        <mxCell id="n_dep" value="&lt;b&gt;Deploy&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;deploy.yml robocopy /MIR → D:\sydoc\nexora.&lt;br&gt;Runtime needs only nx_main.py, nx_lib/, templates/,&lt;br&gt;static/, translations/, web.config.&lt;br&gt;New top-level path the app does not need? add /XF or /XD.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Migrations&lt;/b&gt; apply to PROD &lt;i&gt;before&lt;/i&gt; the pool stops.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;env/*.env&lt;/b&gt; is gitignored → never deployed; run scripts/env-sync.py." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1680" y="110" width="340" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
