        <mxCell id="n_wi" value="&lt;b&gt;Consequences of compound identity&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Detail routes take ?client=&amp;lt;code&amp;gt;.&lt;br&gt;• Per-workitem caches key on (client, id).&lt;br&gt;• Front-end element ids include the client.&lt;br&gt;• NexoraDB workitem metadata is still client-less.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Media host DNS:&lt;/b&gt; a no-dot Octo media host is rewritten&lt;br&gt;to the gateway FQDN — not MS02-only.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Full detail: docs/design/ms02-multisource.md" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="950" width="800" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
